OL,5,G2315 The Debrief with Dan and ROG
OL,6,     FClaire Thomas is joined by Dan
OL,7,     FBiggar and Japan coach Eddie Jones
OL,8,     Fto pick over all the talking
OL,9,     Fpoints from the opening weekend of
OL,10,     Fthe autumn instalment of the
OL,11,     FNations Championship. England were
OL,12,     Fdesperate to start their campaign
OL,13,     Fwith a win against Australia,
OL,14,     FScotland were aiming to beat New
OL,15,     FZealand for the very first time,
OL,16,     FWales were targeting a home win
OL,17,     Fagainst Japan and Ireland faced a
OL,18,     Ftricky test against Argentina in
OL,19,     FDublin
